      "description": "Start date: 2026-05-22\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nFull time\n\nAll Job Postings will close at 12:01a.m. CST (1:01a.m. EST) on the specified Closing Date (if designated). If you close the browser or exit your application prior to submitting, the application progress will be saved as a draft. You will be able to access and complete the application through “My Draft Applications” located on your Candidate Home page. Job Posting Title: Architecture Instructor (Multiple Positions: Full-Time and/or Part-Time)     Position Type: Faculty     Department: LSUAM AD - School of Architecture (Marwan Ghandour (00048308))     Work Location: 0136 T.W. Atkinson Hall     Pay Grade:     Job Description: This is a temporary position that will allow our unit to meet its instructional needs and ensure our students are able to enroll in the necessary degree required courses. Job Responsibilities 100% -- Teach courses as needed in undergraduate and / or graduate programs in Architecture Minimum Qualifications Master's in Architecture or a design related field.     Additional Job Description: Special Instructions: Applicants should provide the following through the university’s online application portal: 1. Letter of interest 2. Complete resume 3. Names and contact information of three professional references 4. Portfolio (pdf or link) of professional and/or academic work Please contact Elizabeth Duffy at eduffy@lsu.edu if you have any questions regarding these positions.     Posting Date: May 22, 2026     Closing Date (Open Until Filled if No Date Specified): November 18, 2026    Additional Position Information: Background Check - An offer of employment is contingent on a satisfactory pre-employment background check. Benefits - LSU offers outstanding benefits to eligible employees and their dependents including health, life, dental, and vision insurance; flexible spending accounts; retirement options; various leave options; paid holidays; wellness benefits; tuition