ccine Protocol: LSUE requires proof of vaccination status for all students, faculty, and staff. New employees must submit proof of vaccination or a waiver within three (3) days of their official start date.     HCM Contact Information: Questions or concerns can be directed to the LSUE Human Resources Management Office at 337-550-1222 or emailed at hr@lsue.edu ."
